    "REAL SoDEX MAINNET registrations the engines ACCEPTED, read from the public CLOB explorer",
    "(GET https://clobscan-mainnet.sodex.dev/api/v1/{spot|perps}/transaction?tx_hash=...) on 2026-10-02.",
    "They are public appchain transactions; nothing here was signed or sent by this project.",
    "Each `signature` is the 66-byte wire signature the wallet produced (0x02 || r || s || v).",
    "`ownerKeccak` is keccak256 of the account owner's 20 address bytes - the address itself is not stored.",
    "The explorer reports `publicKey` as base64 of the 20 key-address bytes; it is hex here.",
    "What they prove: the typed data sodex-core hands to a wallet for these two actions is the typed data",
    "the mainnet engines verify (the recovered signer is the account owner), including the rule that the",
    "DOMAIN chainId is the signatureChainID / X-API-Chain value while the MESSAGE chainID is 286623.",
    "They cover: every registration WITH a builder found on four accounts (all four were signed with",
    "286623 as the domain chain); two keys with names their owners chose (180-day expiry; one of them",
    "signed with domain chain 31337, a local development chain id - the engines take whatever chain id",
    "the request names); and sodex.com app keys signed on Ethereum (1), Base (8453) and ValueChain (286623).",
    "Of the 89 registrations read on those four accounts (85 without a builder, 4 with one; 88 accepted),",
    "every signature recovers the owner under one of these two structs and none under the documented",
    "plain AddAPIKey struct."
